---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Business & Payments — Nexus Wave Technologies" description="Business information, products, pricing, billing and payment information for Nexus Wave Technologies.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-shell">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Business information</p><h1>Nexus Wave Technologies</h1><p class="lead">Accessible digital products, AI tools, productivity utilities and community support services developed from India.</p></div>
    <div class="hero-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Business model</p><h2>Free core services + paid premium AI capabilities.</h2><p class="muted">Women Safety and core non-AI services are free. Only clearly labelled AI and premium tools may require payment.</p></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-2">
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Business details</p><h2>Who operates this service?</h2>
      <dl class="details"><dt>Business / brand</dt><dd>Nexus Wave Technologies</dd><dt>Founder</dt><dd>Kuldeep Kumar Yadav</dd><dt>Country</dt><dd>India</dd><dt>Website</dt><dd>nexusweb.co.in</dd><dt>Support email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a></dd><dt>Product email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:kuldeepky538@gmail.com">kuldeepky538@gmail.com</a></dd></dl>
    </article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">What we sell</p><h2>Products and services</h2><ul class="feature-list"><li>Nexus Plus AI assistant and premium AI capabilities.</li><li>AI credit/top-up services where explicitly offered.</li><li>Premium productivity, media and document tools where marked paid.</li><li>Free Women Safety information and support pathways.</li><li>Free Community, Posts, migration/help information and core utilities.</li><li>Geeta Nexus spiritual learning experiences.</li></ul></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-3">
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Free</p><h3>Women Safety</h3><p class="muted">The Women Safety Center and its public help resources are intended to remain free.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Free</p><h3>Core services</h3><p class="muted">Community, Posts, migration information and designated core utilities are free unless explicitly stated otherwise.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Paid</p><h3>Premium AI</h3><p class="muted">Paid access is limited to AI features, premium AI tools and other capabilities clearly labelled before purchase.</p></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container card">
    <h2>Payments, taxes and refunds</h2>
    <p class="muted">Where payment is offered, the checkout should clearly show the product, price, currency, billing period, applicable taxes/fees and refund terms before confirmation. A payment provider such as PayU may process the transaction.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/legal/refund">Refund Policy</a><a class="button" href="/legal/terms">Terms & Conditions</a><a class="button" href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section surface-soft"><div class="container grid-2">
    <article class="card"><h2>Accessibility</h2><p class="muted">Nexus prioritizes screen-reader support, semantic navigation, keyboard access, clear headings and readable controls.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Customer support</h2><p class="muted">For billing, product or payment questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a>. Never send passwords, OTPs or full payment-card details by email.</p></article>
  </div></section>
</Layout>